fter us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving us-east on v2.3.0 and the other regions on v2.3.1. I retried the same rollback once and it completed in all regions.\n- **Incident:** The first attempt to open the incident timed out. I retried with the same idempotency key, and INC-0001 was created once. The summary covers the cause, the rollback, the partial failure, and the retry.\n\nFollow-ups for the on-call engineer: find the cause of the v2.3.1 failure, look into the orchestrator error that halted the first rollout, and confirm checkout traffic has recovered.", "type": "text"}]}]}